{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49565","headline":"後庭花 二 · 毛熙震","name":"後庭花 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻盈舞伎含芳艳，竞妆新脸。\n步摇珠翠修蛾歛，腻鬟云染。\n歌声慢发开檀点，绣衫斜掩。\n时将纤手匀红脸，笑拈金靥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛熙震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}